---
description: Open Agent Hackathon 2026 stack rules (Nemotron + Zetaris)
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- Follow the rules in the repository root `.cursorrules`.
- Credentials come only from `.env` / `.env.local`; never hardcode or print them.
- Nemotron is accessed through the OpenAI-compatible `openai` SDK (NVIDIA NIM or Meterless base URL).
- Zetaris access is read-only unless the user explicitly approves a write.
- Validate the environment with `python scripts/validate_stack.py`.
